  "subtitle": "Spiced chicken in a mustard and cream sauce on toasted bread",
  "excerpt": "Thinly sliced chicken thighs cooked fast in butter with Worcestershire sauce, mustard and a little chilli, then finished with cream. This is a very British kind of supper. Quick, rich and very good on thick toast.",
